          "note": "Marketplace",
          "author": "Big Bible Stories for Little Hearts",
          "description": "Easter is one of the most surprising stories ever told: light bursts into darkness, a mighty King chooses to serve, and death itself is not the end of the story: it’s the beginning of hope. Journey with Jesus and His disciples through the unforgettable events of Holy Week: the joy of the triumphal entry, the intimacy of the Last Supper, the sorrow of the cross, and the wonder of the empty tomb. Through 14 stories and 3 songs, listeners will experience Easter in a new way - feeling the joy, awe, and life-changing truth that Jesus is alive!",
